      },
      "dc:source": "copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The author of a work has a right of attribution of authorship in\nrespect of the work.\n\n(2) The author’s right is the right to be identified in accordance with\nthis Division as the author of the work if any of the acts (the\nattributable acts) mentioned in section 194 are done in respect of\nthe work.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The author of a work has a right of attribution of authorship in\nrespect of the work.\n\n(2) The author’s right is the right to be identified in accordance with\nthis Division as the author of the work if any of the acts (the\nattributable acts) mentioned in section 194 are done in respect of\nthe work.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-193-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-193-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "700ee5a9d1e066469fc77a538722bf2fbce470dd4da1803b1c418c1bb7b3460a"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000#sch-1-sec-193",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "193 Author’s right of attribution of authorship",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The author of a work has a right of attribution of authorship in\nrespect of the work.\n\n(2) The author’s right is the right to be identified in accordance with\nthis Division as the author of the work if any of the acts (the\nattributable acts) mentioned in section 194 are done in respect of\nthe work."
    },
