      },
      "dc:source": "copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000.pdf, p.15",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The author of a work has a right of integrity of authorship in\nrespect of the work.\n\n(2) The author’s right is the right not to have the work subjected to\nderogatory treatment.",
