    {
      "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195an-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "195AN(4) Exercise of moral rights",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000#sch-1-sec-195an-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If:\n\n(a) a cinematograph film; or\n\n(b) a literary, dramatic, musical or artistic work as included in a\ncinematograph film;\nhas 2 or more authors, the authors may enter into a written\nco-authorship agreement by which each of them agrees not to\nexercise his or her right of integrity of authorship in respect of the\nfilm or work, as the case may be, except jointly with the other\nauthor or authors.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If:\n\n(a) a cinematograph film; or\n\n(b) a literary, dramatic, musical or artistic work as included in a\ncinematograph film;\nhas 2 or more authors, the authors may enter into a written\nco-authorship agreement by which each of them agrees not to\nexercise his or her right of integrity of authorship in respect of the\nfilm or work, as the case may be, except jointly with the other\nauthor or authors.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195an"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195an-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195an-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "130d68f4b67964ab71a68b6514ae911c7b4afd88d59e4f850753e40e9d7069bf",
      "skos:note": "Authors must agree not to exercise moral rights except jointly."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000#sch-1-sec-195an-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "195AN(4) Exercise of moral rights",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 16,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If:\n\n(a) a cinematograph film; or\n\n(b) a literary, dramatic, musical or artistic work as included in a\ncinematograph film;\nhas 2 or more authors, the authors may enter into a written\nco-authorship agreement by which each of them agrees not to\nexercise his or her right of integrity of authorship in respect of the\nfilm or work, as the case may be, except jointly with the other\nauthor or authors."
    },
