    {
      "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195at-ss-2a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "195AT(2A) Certain treatment of works not to constitute an infringement",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000#sch-1-sec-195at-ss-2a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000.pdf, p.21",
      "values:originalText": "(2A) This subsection is complied with by the owner of a building in\nrelation to a change in, or the relocation, demolition or destruction\nof, the building if:\n\n(a) the owner has, in accordance with the regulations and before\nthe change, relocation, demolition or destruction is carried\nout, given the author or a person representing the author a\nwritten notice stating the owner’s intention to carry out the\nchange, relocation, demolition or destruction; and\n\n(b) the notice stated that the person to whom the notice was\ngiven may, within 3 weeks from the date of the notice, seek\nto have access to the work for either or both of the following\npurposes:\n\n(i) making a record of the work;\n\n(ii) consulting in good faith with the owner about the\nchange, relocation, demolition or destruction; and\n\n(c) the notice contained such other information and particulars as\nare prescribed; and\n\n(d) where the person to whom the notice was given notifies the\nowner within the period of 3 weeks referred to in\nparagraph (b) that the person wishes to have access to the\nwork for either or both of the purposes mentioned in that\nparagraph—the owner has given the person a reasonable\nopportunity within a further period of 3 weeks to have such\naccess; and\n\n(e) where, in the case of a change or relocation, the person to\nwhom the notice was given notifies the owner that the person\nrequires the removal from the work of the author’s\nidentification as the author of the work—the owner has\ncomplied with the requirement.\n\nMoral rights of authors  Schedule 1",
      "skos:definition": "(2A) This subsection is complied with by the owner of a building in\nrelation to a change in, or the relocation, demolition or destruction\nof, the building if:\n\n(a) the owner has, in accordance with the regulations and before\nthe change, relocation, demolition or destruction is carried\nout, given the author or a person representing the author a\nwritten notice stating the owner’s intention to carry out the\nchange, relocation, demolition or destruction; and\n\n(b) the notice stated that the person to whom the notice was\ngiven may, within 3 weeks from the date of the notice, seek\nto have access to the work for either or both of the following\npurposes:\n\n(i) making a record of the work;\n\n(ii) consulting in good faith with the owner about the\nchange, relocation, demolition or destruction; and\n\n(c) the notice contained such other information and particulars as\nare prescribed; and\n\n(d) where the person to whom the notice was given notifies the\nowner within the period of 3 weeks referred to in\nparagraph (b) that the person wishes to have access to the\nwork for either or both of the purposes mentioned in that\nparagraph—the owner has given the person a reasonable\nopportunity within a further period of 3 weeks to have such\naccess; and\n\n(e) where, in the case of a change or relocation, the person to\nwhom the notice was given notifies the owner that the person\nrequires the removal from the work of the author’s\nidentification as the author of the work—the owner has\ncomplied with the requirement.\n\nMoral rights of authors  Schedule 1",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195at"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195at-ss-2a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195at-ss-2a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "835c22e441fd35614668fb25535e79038acd612b1895ea55aa074bc8ac1543ff",
      "skos:note": "Owner must give written notice to author or representative before change, relocation, demolition, or destruction of building.",
      "dc:description": "Written notice stating owner's intention and required information"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000#sch-1-sec-195at-ss-2a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
