      "dc:source": "copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "(1) It is not an infringement of a moral right of an author in respect of\na work to do, or omit to do, something if the act or omission is\nwithin the scope of a written consent given by the author or a\nperson representing the author.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) It is not an infringement of a moral right of an author in respect of\na work to do, or omit to do, something if the act or omission is\nwithin the scope of a written consent given by the author or a\nperson representing the author.",
