      "values:originalText": "(4) A consent may be given by an employee for the benefit of his or\nher employer in relation to all works made or to be made by the\nemployee in the course of his or her employment."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195aw-ss-4-norm",
