    {
      "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195aw-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "195AW(3) Author’s consent to act or omission—films or works in films",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000#sch-1-sec-195aw-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subject to subsection (4), a consent does not have any effect unless\nit is given:\n\n(a) in relation to specified acts or omissions, or specified classes\nor types of acts or omissions, whether occurring before or\nafter the consent is given; and\n\n(b) in relation to either of the following:\n\n(i) a specified work or specified works existing when the\nconsent is given; or\n\n(ii) a specified work, or works of a particular description,\nthe making of which has not begun or that is or are in\nthe course of being made.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Subject to subsection (4), a consent does not have any effect unless\nit is given:\n\n(a) in relation to specified acts or omissions, or specified classes\nor types of acts or omissions, whether occurring before or\nafter the consent is given; and\n\n(b) in relation to either of the following:\n\n(i) a specified work or specified works existing when the\nconsent is given; or\n\n(ii) a specified work, or works of a particular description,\nthe making of which has not begun or that is or are in\nthe course of being made.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195aw"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195aw-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195aw-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195aw-ss-3-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b7af528e3fb411fceac4a7f6ee2d43fce090ee1d2f94cdbed34aafed4405ca71",
      "skos:note": "Consent must be given in relation to specified acts or omissions, works, or classes of acts/omissions. Consent may be given for specified works or works of a particular description."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000#sch-1-sec-195aw-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "195AW(3) Author’s consent to act or omission—films or works in films",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 26,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subject to subsection (4), a consent does not have any effect unless\nit is given:\n\n(a) in relation to specified acts or omissions, or specified classes\nor types of acts or omissions, whether occurring before or\nafter the consent is given; and\n\n(b) in relation to either of the following:\n\n(i) a specified work or specified works existing when the\nconsent is given; or\n\n(ii) a specified work, or works of a particular description,\nthe making of which has not begun or that is or are in\nthe course of being made."
    },
