      "values:originalText": "(1) If a person applies duress to an author, or to a person representing\nan author, in connection with the giving of a consent for the\npurposes of section 195AW or 195AWA, the consent does not\nhave any effect.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If a person applies duress to an author, or to a person representing\nan author, in connection with the giving of a consent for the\npurposes of section 195AW or 195AWA, the consent does not\nhave any effect.",
