      "dc:source": "copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this Division:\naction means a proceeding of a civil nature between parties, and\nincludes a counterclaim.\n\n(2) In the application of this Division in relation to a counterclaim,\nreferences to the defendant are taken to be references to the\nplaintiff.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) In this Division:\naction means a proceeding of a civil nature between parties, and\nincludes a counterclaim.\n\n(2) In the application of this Division in relation to a counterclaim,\nreferences to the defendant are taken to be references to the\nplaintiff.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195ay-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195ay-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bf5be73c30bc58ec4abfdabecd2d7f2ddf238a9cf97a8c5b8b3693a2e4f5bae9"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000#sch-1-sec-195ay",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "195AY Definition etc.",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 28,
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this Division:\naction means a proceeding of a civil nature between parties, and\nincludes a counterclaim.\n\n(2) In the application of this Division in relation to a counterclaim,\nreferences to the defendant are taken to be references to the\nplaintiff."
    },
