    {
      "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195az-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "195AZ(3) Actions for infringement of moral rights",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000#sch-1-sec-195az-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In deciding whether or not to grant an injunction under subsection\n(1), the court must consider whether the parties have made any\nattempt to negotiate a settlement of the action and whether it\nshould adjourn the hearing or further hearing of the action for the\npurpose of giving the parties an appropriate opportunity to\nnegotiate a settlement, whether through a process of mediation or\notherwise.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In deciding whether or not to grant an injunction under subsection\n(1), the court must consider whether the parties have made any\nattempt to negotiate a settlement of the action and whether it\nshould adjourn the hearing or further hearing of the action for the\npurpose of giving the parties an appropriate opportunity to\nnegotiate a settlement, whether through a process of mediation or\notherwise.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195az"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195az-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195az-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195az-ss-3-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195az-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "135acb82df5ca8b5945c80418ac5a9894e6e9bf159d9b3545c1b7c88c07a0dec",
      "skos:note": "Appeal from a decision of a court under this Part Damages recovered in other proceedings are to be taken into account. Court must consider negotiating a settlement before granting an injunction."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000#sch-1-sec-195az-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "195AZ(3) Actions for infringement of moral rights",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 28,
      "values:originalText": "(3) In deciding whether or not to grant an injunction under subsection\n(1), the court must consider whether the parties have made any\nattempt to negotiate a settlement of the action and whether it\nshould adjourn the hearing or further hearing of the action for the\npurpose of giving the parties an appropriate opportunity to\nnegotiate a settlement, whether through a process of mediation or\notherwise."
    },
    {
