    {
      "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195az-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "195AZ(6) Actions for infringement of moral rights",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000#sch-1-sec-195az-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If, in respect of an act done after the death of an author of a work,\ndamages are recovered under this section by the legal personal\nrepresentative of the author, those damages devolve as if they\nformed part of the author’s estate and as if the right of action in\nrespect of the doing of the act had subsisted, and had been vested\nin the author, immediately before his or her death.\nNote:\nSubsection (6) does not apply in relation to the right of integrity of\nauthorship in respect of a cinematograph film, which ends on the\nauthor’s death. See subsection 195AM(1).\n195AZB  Saving of other rights and remedies",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If, in respect of an act done after the death of an author of a work,\ndamages are recovered under this section by the legal personal\nrepresentative of the author, those damages devolve as if they\nformed part of the author’s estate and as if the right of action in\nrespect of the doing of the act had subsisted, and had been vested\nin the author, immediately before his or her death.\nNote:\nSubsection (6) does not apply in relation to the right of integrity of\nauthorship in respect of a cinematograph film, which ends on the\nauthor’s death. See subsection 195AM(1).\n195AZB  Saving of other rights and remedies",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195az"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195az-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000-sch-1-sec-195az-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7b567e42aed48f832c427d4493be9ce6fcbf51029d59b68135d841d7548d55aa",
      "skos:note": "Damages recovered under this section devolve as if they formed part of the author's estate."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000#sch-1-sec-195az-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "195AZ(6) Actions for infringement of moral rights",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 28,
      "values:originalText": "(6) If, in respect of an act done after the death of an author of a work,\ndamages are recovered under this section by the legal personal\nrepresentative of the author, those damages devolve as if they\nformed part of the author’s estate and as if the right of action in\nrespect of the doing of the act had subsisted, and had been vested\nin the author, immediately before his or her death.\nNote:\nSubsection (6) does not apply in relation to the right of integrity of\nauthorship in respect of a cinematograph film, which ends on the\nauthor’s death. See subsection 195AM(1).\n195AZB  Saving of other rights and remedies"
    },
