      },
      "dc:source": "copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The jurisdiction of the Supreme Court of a State or Territory in a\nmatter arising under this Part is to be exercised by a single Judge of\nthe Court.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The jurisdiction of the Supreme Court of a State or Territory in a\nmatter arising under this Part is to be exercised by a single Judge of\nthe Court.",
