      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f6df52d1e3982652928e41cb797cfb90a45eb37be0e5225870dd3f85325baaa7",
      "skos:note": "Jurisdiction of the Supreme Court in a matter arising under this Part is to be exercised by a single Judge. No effect on other remedies in proceedings under this Part Section 127 applies in respect of an action brought under this Part. Court may grant injunctions, damages, declaration, apology, or removal of false attribution in moral rights infringement action."
    },
