      "values:originalText": "(3) An appeal lies from a decision of a court of a State or Territory\nunder this Part:\n\n(a) to the Federal Court of Australia; or\n\n(b) by special leave of the High Court, to the High Court.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) An appeal lies from a decision of a court of a State or Territory\nunder this Part:\n\n(a) to the Federal Court of Australia; or\n\n(b) by special leave of the High Court, to the High Court.",
